{"timestamp":"2026-09-23T08:49:39.714Z","ordinal":17889,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0c2a9-e321-7e31-8c9d-08070b38ca84","turn_id":"01a0ccb0-75a7-7862-941a-ed4430a5b3b7","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0e181e26ba53657d016ab392a1660887d09f88f7fe95bc7573","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"`DROP TABLESPACE`、`DROP UNDO TABLESPACE`、`DROP LOGFILE GROUP`を別の型にしました。UNDO表領域の削除にはWAIT指定を持たせず、他の二つでは完了待ちの方針を保持します。旧リリースの重複オプション規則も含め、追加した49テストが通っています。\n"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1790153377421,"completed_at_ms":1790153379714}}
