Statement L316: \\nL317:         * cite160†Cursor OPEN Statement L318: \\nL319:         * cite161†Restrictions on Server-Side Cursors L320: \\nL321:       * cite162†Condition Handling L322: \\nL323:         * cite163†DECLARE ... CONDITION Statement L324: \\nL325:         * cite164†DECLARE ... HANDLER Statement L326: \\nL327:         * cite165†GET DIAGNOSTICS Statement L328: \\nL329:         * cite166†RESIGNAL Statement L330: \\nL331:         * cite167†SIGNAL Statement L332: \\nL333:         * cite168†Scope Rules for Handlers L334:         * cite169†The MySQL Diagnostics Area L335: \\nL336:         * cite170†Condition Handling and OUT or INOUT Parameters L337: \\nL338:       * cite171†Restrictions on Condition Handling L339: \\nL340:     * cite172†Database Administration Statements L341: \\nL342:       * cite173†Account Management Statements L343: \\nL344:         * cite174†ALTER USER Statement L345: \\nL346:         * cite175†CREATE ROLE Statement L347: \\nL348:         * cite176†CREATE USER Statement L349: \\nL350:         * cite177†DROP ROLE Statement L351: \\nL352:         * cite178†DROP USER Statement L353: \\nL354:         * cite179†GRANT Statement L355:         * cite180†RENAME USER Statement L356: \\nL357:         * cite181†REVOKE Statement L358: \\nL359:         * cite182†SET DEFAULT ROLE Statement L360: \\nL361:         * cite183†SET PASSWORD Statement L362: \\nL363:         * cite184†SET ROLE Statement L364: \\nL365:       * cite185†Resource Group Management Statements L366: \\nL367:         * cite186†ALTER RESOURCE GROUP Statement L368: \\nL369:         * cite187†CREATE RESOURCE GROUP Statement L370: \\nL371:         * cite188†DROP RESOURCE GROUP Statement L372: \\nL373:         * cite189†SET RESOURCE GROUP Statement L374: \\nL375:       * cite190†Table Maintenance Statements L376:         * cite191†ANALYZE TABLE Statement L377: \\nL378:         * cite192†CH